<title>GERMANY: Kolbenschmidt Rheinmetall merger delayed.</title>
<headline>Kolbenschmidt Rheinmetall merger delayed.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>German auto parts maker Kolbenschmidt AG said on Thursday that there would be a delay in its planned merger with the German electronics and engineering group Rheinmetall.</p>
<p>Koblenschmidt said in a statement that the management board and supervisory board of the two companies were keeping their original intentions.</p>
<p>&quot;The negotiations will continue as quickly as possible,&quot; Kolbenschmidt said.</p>
<p>The German federal cartel office recently approved the merger.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
